from pathlib import Path
p=Path(__file__).parent.parent/'dist'
info={
'additional-services':('A specialist request needs a specific brief','Pops and bangs, popcorn limiter and RPM calibration enquiries are assessed for verified dedicated closed-course motorsport vehicles only. Rev and speed limiter settings require technical assessment, event compliance and retention of necessary protections.','Swirl flap software support','For road vehicles, the enquiry covers software-related fault diagnosis and appropriate repair options with required emissions systems functional. Swirl flap software removal is not advertised for road use. Pricing: Starting from £120; compatibility, scope and final price are agreed before booking.'),
'stage-1-remapping':('A starting point for standard vehicles','Stage 1 normally considers petrol or diesel vehicles with standard hardware. Diesel owners can choose to discuss performance, economy or a balanced 50/50 blend within a suitable Stage 1 calibration. ECU access method, engine variant and transmission limits affect what is suitable. Existing warning lights or mechanical issues should be investigated first.','What to send','Your registration, engine size, fuel type and any modifications help identify the correct specification.'),
'stage-2-tuning':('Hardware and software need to work together','Stage 2 and Stage 2+ labels are not universal specifications. Supporting hardware, fuel requirements and the intended use must be discussed for your particular vehicle. A software change should follow a clear assessment of the complete setup.','Before requesting a quote','List existing hardware changes and any future plans. Required parts and supporting repairs are not included in the published starting price unless explicitly quoted.'),
'ecu-remapping':('What bench ECU remapping involves','Bench tuning uses direct connections to an ECU removed from the vehicle. Specialist equipment connects to its communication pins or connectors on a workbench to access compatible software for custom calibration.','Assess the ECU first','The correct access method depends on the ECU hardware and software. Share your registration, engine details and intended outcome; ECU removal and any specialist access requirements must be agreed before work begins.'),
'performance-remapping':('Define the driving change you want','Performance priorities may include throttle response, torque delivery and how power builds across the rev range. The appropriate approach depends on engine, drivetrain and mechanical condition. No fixed gain is promised.','Think beyond peak figures','Describe how the vehicle is used, the fuel normally used and any existing drivability concerns. Discuss insurance and warranty implications before committing.'),
'economy-remapping':('A diesel remap around your priorities','Performance, economy and a balanced 50/50 blend are alternative calibration priorities within the same diesel remapping service. Discuss your daily driving, load and intended use to choose a suitable direction.','Vehicle-specific results','The engine, transmission, condition and driving style affect the outcome. No fixed fuel saving or power figure is guaranteed. Contact us for details and a quote.'),
'gearbox-tuning':('Transmission software matched to the vehicle','Gearbox and TCU flashing can adjust compatible shift and torque-management strategies. The aim is an appropriate response for your setup, within the assessed limits of the transmission.','Check mechanical health first','Clutch slip, harsh shifts or existing faults need diagnosis. Software does not repair worn components. Send your gearbox type, modifications and symptoms before booking. Starting from £199. Final pricing depends on the agreed work.'),
 'tcu-cloning':('Replacement controller compatibility','TCU cloning concerns transferring compatible controller data to a replacement unit. The original and replacement hardware references, software versions and data condition can affect feasibility.','Before sending a controller','Contact us with part numbers, vehicle details and the reason for replacement. Do not send parts until compatibility and the handling process have been agreed.'),
'software-upgrades':('Assess the exact software request','Vehicle software services depend on the controller, current version and hardware configuration. Describe the feature or issue you want to discuss so compatibility, scope and lawful use can be checked.','A defined scope','No blanket feature unlocking, safety restriction removal or emissions defeat is offered. Available options must be confirmed for the individual vehicle.'),
'vehicle-diagnostics':('Fault codes are a starting point','A fault code identifies a reported system concern, but does not on its own prove which part needs replacing. Symptoms, service history and the circumstances in which the fault occurs help guide investigation.','Help us understand the symptoms','Include warning light details, any fault codes already read, when the issue occurs and recent repair work. Avoid clearing codes before discussing the issue.'),
'adblue-diagnostics':('Investigate the SCR system','AdBlue and NOx-related warnings can involve several parts of the selective catalytic reduction system. A diagnostic approach considers the reported codes and symptoms before a compliant repair route is discussed.','Share the warning exactly','Tell us whether a countdown or restart warning appears and send the wording or a photo through WhatsApp. Diagnostic and repair pricing is quoted individually; deletion prices do not apply.'),
'dpf-diagnostics':('DPF and EGR faults need a joined-up assessment','Particulate filter warnings and exhaust gas recirculation faults can be linked to operating conditions, sensors or wider engine concerns. Share symptoms and fault codes so the underlying cause can be investigated.','Compliant solutions','The service covers diagnosis and suitable repair options with required emissions controls retained. Diagnostic and repair prices are quoted individually; deletion prices are not repair prices.'),
'egr-diagnostics':('Understand the recirculation fault','EGR symptoms can overlap with other intake and engine concerns. Codes, running symptoms and component condition help establish whether further tests or repairs are needed.','Keep the repair appropriate','Contact us with the vehicle registration, symptoms and fault codes. The enquiry is for diagnostics and compliant repair solutions with required emissions controls retained.'),
'swirl-flap-repair':('Investigate intake operation','Swirl flaps and their control mechanisms form part of certain intake systems. Actuator, linkage and intake concerns need vehicle-specific investigation before deciding on repair options.','Describe what has changed','Share warning lights, unusual running behaviour and any diagnosis already carried out. Compatibility, parts and repair scope are confirmed after assessment.')}
for slug,(title,body,t2,b2) in info.items():
 f=p/'services'/slug/'index.html';s=f.read_text();new=f'<section class="section shade"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">SERVICE INSIGHT</div><h2>{title}</h2><div class="twocol"><p class="large">{body}</p><div><h3>{t2}</h3><p>{b2}</p></div></div></div></section>'
 s=s.replace('<section class="section shade"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT TO EXPECT',new+'<section class="section shade"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT TO EXPECT');f.write_text(s)
for f in list(p.rglob('index.html'))+[p/'404.html']:
 s=f.read_text().replace('© 2026 RemapWorks UK','© 2026 RemapWorks UK · Illustrative imagery');f.write_text(s)
